## Anti-Patterns

- Do NOT restate the query as a capability. Children compose the parent; they do not paraphrase it.
- Do NOT let ambient-layer suppression reduce the capability count.
- Do NOT mix altitudes in the capability set.
- Do NOT write advocacy prose before computing `fit_score`.
- Do NOT award an evidence item without citable catalog text.
- Do NOT record `harvest-pattern` as a match.
- Do NOT select a `constraint_blocked` component.
- Do NOT hallucinate components — only what appears in `RETRIEVED CODE`.
- Do NOT reject partial matches — band them honestly with `adaptation_notes`.
- Do NOT assign `match_type` independently of `fit_score`.
- Do NOT omit `org`, or the cross-team risk that `extend-in-place` implies.
- Do NOT emit an empty `gaps` array unless every match is `Full Match`.
- Do NOT report `overall_confidence_score` that disagrees with the Phase 12 computation.
- Do NOT pad `catalog_matches` with components no capability required.
- Do NOT report a `Full Match` on a `core` capability without a `differentiation_flag` justification.

---

## Quality Rubric

| Criterion | Weight | Pass Condition |
|---|---|---|
| Decomposition validity | 20% | ≥ 3 capabilities; MECE; constant altitude; compositional, not restatement |
| Catalog honesty | 15% | Every match exists in `RETRIEVED CODE`; every evidence item cites real catalog text |
| Coverage integrity | 15% | Coverage invariant holds; each capability resolved exactly once |
| Confidence calibration | 15% | `match_type` derived from `fit_score`; overall matches the Phase 12 formula |
| Reuse realism | 15% | Every match has a viable `reuse_mode` with its precondition satisfied |
| Composability analysis | 10% | Mismatch axes assessed; conflicts between selected components raised |
| Gap actionability | 10% | Gaps carry effort, rationale, interfaces, and precedent |

---

## Evaluation

Machine-checkable gates. Any failure → reject and regenerate.

- `3 <= len(capabilities) <= 8`
- No two capabilities share a responsibility (MECE assertion recorded)
- Every `capability_id` appears exactly once across `catalog_matches ∪ gaps`
- `len(coverage_matrix) == len(capabilities)`
- Every `catalog_matches[].component_name` exists verbatim in `RETRIEVED CODE`
- Every `catalog_matches[].fit_score` equals the sum of its `evidence_awarded` points
- Every `match_type` matches the band derived from its `fit_score`
- `E2 not awarded` implies `fit_score <= 45`
- No selected match has `constraint_blocked == true`
- No selected match has `reuse_mode == "harvest-pattern"`
- Every non-`Full Match` has non-empty `adaptation_notes`
- Every `extend-in-place` and `fork` has a corresponding entry in `risks`
- Every `core` capability with a `Full Match` has a `differentiation_flag` justification
- `gaps == []` implies every `match_type == "Full Match"`
- Every gap has `capability_id`, `build_effort`, `effort_rationale`, `suggested_interfaces`
- `overall_confidence_score` equals the Phase 12 computation within ±2
- `requirement_summary` and `architecture_composition` non-empty

