## Search Strategy

```yaml
mode: catalog
strategy: multi_query_fusion
queries:
  - source: original_user_query
    limit: 15
  - source: each_capability          # one query per Phase 1 capability
    limit: 10
fusion:
  method: rank_fusion
  k: 60
rerank:
  enabled: true
  scope: per_capability              # rerank the fused shortlist against each capability separately
min_score: 0.40                       # low: Adaptation-Required candidates are useful signal
dedup_key: sha256(repo_url + ":" + component_path)
max_total_candidates: 60
shortlist_per_capability: 8
ordering: canonical                   # subdomain_class, then capability_id, then fit_score desc
```

